{"q": 19171, "quiz": 1510, "obj": "P4.FIT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "The end of the book is about pollution. Is this a good end for a book about fish?", "why": "الخاتمة تتصل بموضوع الكتاب لأن التلوث يصيب الأسماك نفسها: «This is pollution, which can hurt fish. Pollution has a bad impact on fish's habitats.»", "opts": [{"t": "Yes. Pollution can hurt fish and their habitats.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "No. Fish do not live in the water.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. Fish throw plastic into the water.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "No. Pollution is good for fish.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
