{"q": 19203, "quiz": 1516, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "How many homes can the Roscoe Wind Farm power?", "why": "في آخر النص أعداد تتنافس (hundreds و627)، والمطلوب عدد البيوت: «They can power 230,000 homes.»", "opts": [{"t": "627 homes.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "Hundreds of homes.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "230,000 homes.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "23,000 homes.", "dx": null, "key": false}]},
{"q": 19204, "quiz": 1516, "obj": "P2.WORD_CONTEXT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Fossil fuels come from \"fossils\". What are fossils?", "why": "المعنى من جملة التعريف التي تلي الكلمة: «Fossils are the remains of plants and animals that lived long ago.»", "opts": [{"t": "Remains of plants and animals from long ago.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Heat and light from the sun.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "Panels on top of some homes.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "Machines with a spin in the wind.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 19205, "quiz": 1516, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "What do solar panels do with sunlight?", "why": "في النص آلتان تتنافسان (الألواح والتوربينات)، والمطلوب عمل الألواح: «The panels collect sunlight and turn it into electricity.»", "opts": [{"t": "They keep it under the ground.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "They turn it into fossil fuels.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "They turn it into electricity.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "They turn it into wind.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
