{"q": 19207, "quiz": 1516, "obj": "P4.VS_ALTERNATIVE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "The book is about fossil fuels and clean energy. What is better for the air, and why?", "why": "النص يعرض الخيارين ويوازن بينهما: «Burning fossil fuels pollutes the air.» وفي المقابل عن الطاقة النظيفة «Such energy does not pollute the air.»", "opts": [{"t": "Clean energy. It does not pollute the air.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Fossil fuels. They do not pollute the air.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Clean energy. It comes from fossils under the ground.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "Fossil fuels. They come from the sun and the wind.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
