{"q": 19156, "quiz": 1508, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Some arthropods eat crops. What does this do?", "why": "في الفقرة ضرران ونفع تتنافس، والمطلوب أثر أكل المحاصيل: «Some eat crops, which damages the food we need.»", "opts": [{"t": "It damages the food we need.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "It helps plants make food.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "It carries diseases to animals.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "It helps flowers grow.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 19157, "quiz": 1508, "obj": "P4.REASON_SUPPORTS", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "The book says, \"some arthropods can be helpful.\" Does it give a good reason for this?", "why": "الدعوى «But some arthropods can be helpful.» يسندها المثال الذي يليها مباشرة: «Bees help pollinate the plants we need for food.»", "opts": [{"t": "Yes. Some insects carry diseases to people.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "No. In the book, all arthropods eat our crops.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. Bees help pollinate plants we need for food.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "No. It gives no example of a helpful arthropod.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
